# Layer 3, business flow "quickfixj-dropcopy": the sequence-number checkpoint
# table and the drop-copy topics behind the quickfixj-v2-demo module.
#
# Nothing here needs to differ from the repo defaults -- same ports, same
# binary, same platform. The file exists so every flow folder has the same
# two files and the layering order stays uniform; see
# docs/src/server-env-layering.md.
#
# The module's own compose file (quickfixj-v2-demo/compose.yml) mounts this
# folder into its AMPS service directly, so the same config serves both the
# repo-wide amps.sh / amps-compose.sh path and the module's three-container
# stack.
